title: Case Manager › Reviews this week › The list
route: /manager?tab=reviews
intro: The second tab lists every clinical review due this week, one card per day, with three tiles on top. Agents have already drafted most of them. A row opens the review drawer. A side card nudges the team to look at cases that may be ready for a lower level of care. Every count and row is for the sites in view (Both sites 47 = Site A 27 plus Site B 20), and the side card lists only its cases at those sites.
dir: TD
---
start s1 "Click 'Reviews this week'"
screen t0 "Three tiles (not clickable)\n47 'Reviews due this week', '0 signed so far, 4 not drafted yet'\n35 'Drafted by agents', '29 clean, ready to sign'\n8 'Need a clinician update', 'what is missing is listed'"
process p0 "Tiles count all reviews and ignore the filters\nWhen filters hide some: 'Showing 8 of 47 reviews. The tiles count all 47.'\nWith no updates left the third tile says 'nothing waiting on you'\nAfter 'Draft all due reviews': 39 drafted, 33 clean, and the 'not drafted yet' part is gone"
process p1 "One review exists for each approved case (47 of 56)\nTimes run from today to Sunday\nOnly reviews due before the end of Sunday are listed and counted\nA next review booked by a signature joins its day if it falls this week (Detox reviews do: every 3 days)"

group gDays "Day cards, in date order"
  screen d1 "Card for one day\nTitle 'Today' (the demo day) or the weekday, date 'Tue 10/20', and '13 reviews' ('1 review' for one)"
  screen d2 "Row: time ('8:30 am'), level chip, case ID, payer and 'C.D., 44'\nFor a review that needs an update: the missing item in amber under the ID\nPills: 'Check to look at' (amber), then 'Not drafted yet', 'Drafted', 'Needs your update' or 'Signed'\nButton 'Open'"
  decision d3 "More than five reviews that day?"
  click c3 "Click 'Show 8 more'"
  click c4 "Click 'Show fewer'"
  process p3 "First five rows show, then the button\nThe rest open under it, and the button changes to 'Show fewer'"
endgroup

click c1 "Click the case ID or 'Open' on a row"
goto g1 "Continues in: Case Manager › Reviews this week › The review drawer"

group gSide "Right side card 'Ready to step down?'"
  screen s2 "'A prompt for your team. It is never a decision.'\nR-0873: 'Day 18 of 21', 'Aftercare visit not booked yet'\nP-1522: 'Day 11', 'IOP starts Monday'"
  click c2 "Click R-0873 or P-1522"
  process p4 "Go to /authorizations/case/ and the ID"
  decision d4 "Is the case a request in the queue?"
  goto g2 "Continues in: Authorizations › Case"
  goto g4 "Continues in: Case Manager › Ledger case › Open and read"
endgroup

process p5 "After Fast-forward 1 day the card for the new day is called 'Today'\nThe old day keeps its reviews and statuses and is named by its weekday"
goto g3 "Continues in: Case Manager › Empty states › Nothing to show"
end e1 "List is on screen"

s1 --> t0 --> p0 --> p1 --> d1 --> d2
d2 --> d3
d3 -->|Yes| c3 --> p3
d3 -->|No| e1
p3 --> c4 --> e1
d2 --> c1 --> g1
p1 --> s2 --> c2 --> p4 --> d4
d4 -->|Yes: P-1522| g2
d4 -->|No: R-0873 is in the ledger| g4
p1 -.-> p5
p0 -.->|No review matches| g3
